{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "title: \"SP KPI Dashboard\"\n",
        "date: today\n",
        "format:\n",
        "  dashboard:\n",
        "    theme: cosmo\n",
        "    scrolling: true\n",
        "    include-in-header:\n",
        "      text: |\n",
        "        <style>\n",
        "          .navbar { display: none !important; }\n",
        "          .quarto-dashboard-content { margin-top: 0 !important; }\n",
        "        </style>\n",
        "execute:\n",
        "  echo: false\n",
        "  warning: false\n",
        "  message: false\n",
        "jupyter: sp-analysis\n",
        "---"
      ],
      "id": "dc1258d5"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| include: false\n",
        "from sp_analysis import load_data, prepare_by_kpi_all_countries, facet_chart_by_country, KPI_LABELS\n",
        "df = load_data()\n",
        "ALL_KPIS = list(KPI_LABELS.keys())\n",
        "long_df = prepare_by_kpi_all_countries(df, ALL_KPIS)"
      ],
      "id": "e2dba8a3",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# {.sidebar}\n",
        "\n",
        "**Countries**\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "<nav class=\"nav flex-column nav-pills\">\n",
        "\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"\">Home</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#austria\">Austria</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#belgium\">Belgium</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#switzerland\">Switzerland</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#czecha\">Czecha</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#germany\">Germany</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#greece\">Greece</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#finland\">Finland</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#france\">France</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#croatia\">Croatia</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#hungary\">Hungary</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#ireland\">Ireland</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#iceland\">Iceland</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#lithuania\">lithuania</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#italy\">Italy</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#Lithuania\">Lithuania</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#netherlands\">Netherlands</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#norway\">Norway</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#macedonia\">North Macedonia</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#portugal\">Portugal</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#sweden\">Sweden</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#slovenia\">Slovenia</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#slovakia\">Slovakia</a>\n",
        "  <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#united-kingdom\">United Kingdom</a>\n",
        "</nav>\n",
        "\n",
        "# Home\n",
        "\n",
        "Thanks to your contributions, CESSDA has now collected key performance indicators (C-KPIs) for 2025 to measure our progress and impact within the European Research Area. \n",
        "\n",
        "This dashboard supports the validation of data. Here are some general instructions:\n",
        "\n",
        "  - **Left sidebar**: Select your country to view the SP-specific dashboard\n",
        "  - **Top right corner [...]**: Download your dashboard as an image or view source code\n",
        "  - **Legends**: \n",
        "    - [Blue]{style=\"color: blue;\"}: Validated data\n",
        "    - [Grey]{style=\"color: grey;\"}: 2025 data pending validation\n",
        "    - [Red]{style=\"color: red;\"}: Missing/unavailable data (displayed as outlier)\n",
        "\n",
        "Note: Please refer to the validation Excel file for the categorical KPIs (i.e., C-KPI-07, 09, 18, 19a)\n",
        "\n",
        "If you identified any errors, please add comments directly in the [Excel file](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1m9Phl1uxPN9hL4zmgSGFMOFs1X-UmjxP/edit?gid=663340094#gid=663340094).\n",
        "\n",
        "Moreover, please complete this short 3-question feedback [survey](https://forms.gle/KJnVJj9qKyhUJCm87) by **2 July 2026**. One response per SP is sufficient.\n",
        "\n",
        "If you have any questions, please contact Lorraine Wong, Senior Science Officer at the CESSDA Main Office <lorraine.wong@cessda.eu>.\n",
        "\n",
        "Thank you for your time and input!\n",
        "\n",
        "# Austria {#austria}\n",
        "\n",
        "## Row"
      ],
      "id": "5a7e7efb"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "facet_chart_by_country(long_df, 'Austria', title='Austria')"
      ],
      "id": "993a0e7a",
